          Max Value: 4000
          Median window: 5
          Min Value: 300
          Name: D435 aligned depth (OFF - what the policy sees)
          Normalize Range: false
          Topic:
            Depth: 5
            Durability Policy: Volatile
            History Policy: Keep Last
            Reliability Policy: Best Effort
